{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>That you may enter the covenant.</b> You stand with all this order and agreement, prepared to enter into the covenant; and from this it is evident that you all desire to accept it upon yourselves with a whole heart." "<b>Which HaShem your Elohim is making with you today, in order to establish you, etc.</b> Now the blessed El intends through this covenant to establish you for Himself as a people, so that He may be for you as Elohim, and through this you shall acquire eternal life. And since the purpose of this covenant is so exceedingly exalted, its acceptance must be undertaken with the utmost perfection."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:29.737349301Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}